CredaFlow face comparison: third-party components

The files in this directory are not CredaFlow's own work. They are used
unmodified, fetched by `npm run face-models:fetch` and checked against pinned
SHA-256 digests (lib/kyc/face-model/models.ts).

face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
  YuNet face detector. OpenCV Zoo, https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo,
  commit 47534e27c9851bb1128ccc0102f1145e27f23f98,
  models/face_detection_yunet/. Copyright (c) 2020 Shiqi Yu.
  MIT License: see LICENSE-face_detection_yunet.

face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx
  SFace face recognizer. OpenCV Zoo, same commit,
  models/face_recognition_sface/.
  Apache License 2.0: see LICENSE-face_recognition_sface.

